        <briefdescription>
<para>Set up a cgroup v2 sub-hierarchy for this sandbox instance. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Creates <computeroutput>/sys/fs/cgroup/themis/&lt;sandbox_id&gt;/</computeroutput>, enables the memory and cpu controllers in <computeroutput>cgroup.subtree_control</computeroutput>, writes <computeroutput>memory.max</computeroutput>, then moves the current process into the new cgroup. If CPU limiting is enabled, <computeroutput>cpu.max</computeroutput> is written later by applyCpuLimit() when active. Returns true on success; on failure emits spdlog::warn and the caller falls back to RLIMIT_* enforcement. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
